      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Sec. 10-3.1. Aggravated unlawful restraint."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "text": "(a) A person commits the offense of aggravated unlawful restraint when he or she commits unlawful restraint while using a deadly weapon."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "text": "(b) Sentence. Aggravated unlawful restraint is a Class 3 felony."
    },
